1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,643
¿Vas a hacer

2
00:00:00,643 --> 00:00:02,647
el Camino desde Sarria?

3
00:00:02,647 --> 00:00:04,840
Estas son sus 5 etapas.

4
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:06,264
Sarria a Portomarín:

5
00:00:06,264 --> 00:00:07,923
22 km entre aldeas

6
00:00:07,923 --> 00:00:09,407
y caminos rurales.

7
00:00:09,407 --> 00:00:11,023
Portomarín a Palas de Rei,

8
00:00:11,023 --> 00:00:12,009
con suaves subidas

9
00:00:12,009 --> 00:00:13,515
y pueblos pequeños.

10
00:00:13,515 --> 00:00:14,964
Palas de Rei a Arzúa,

11
00:00:14,964 --> 00:00:16,597
la más larga.

12
00:00:16,597 --> 00:00:17,451
Si quieres,

13
00:00:17,451 --> 00:00:18,545
la partes con una noche

14
00:00:18,545 --> 00:00:19,559
en Melide.

15
00:00:19,559 --> 00:00:20,839
Arzúa a A Rúa,

16
00:00:20,839 --> 00:00:22,611
entre bosques y aldeas.

17
00:00:22,611 --> 00:00:23,278
Y de A Rúa

18
00:00:23,278 --> 00:00:24,071
a Santiago,

19
00:00:24,071 --> 00:00:25,506
hasta la Catedral.

20
00:00:25,506 --> 00:00:26,991
111 km y tu Compostela.

21
00:00:26,991 --> 00:00:30,240
Guárdalo para tu Camino.
